# Committed build outputs (firmware + host binaries + slot apps).
#
# The repo-root .gitignore ignores *.uf2 globally; re-include ONLY the firmware
# image below. User content is NOT committed here: the boot animation and the
# ANIMATION keyframe UF2s stay local (they live in tools/builds/ and are flashed
# to their own flash partitions per user).
!firmware/ydkb_athena75_rgb_advanced_vial.uf2

# Packaged slot apps (apps/.gitignore ignores *.app under apps/<name>/).
!apps/
!apps/*.app
